ithin the university."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 95, "text": "Title: The Unwavering Dedication of Clara Montagut: A Testament to Her Work at Hospital del Mar"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 97, "end": 267, "text": "In the vibrant city of Barcelona, where the Mediterranean Sea meets the majestic mountains, a renowned hospital stands as a beacon of hope for those seeking medical care."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 268, "end": 389, "text": "Hospital del Mar, with its rich history and commitment to excellence, has been a hub for medical innovation and research."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 390, "end": 548, "text": "Among the many talented professionals who have contributed to its esteemed reputation is Clara Montagut, a researcher with an unwavering passion for her work."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 549, "end": 667, "text": "Clara Montagut, with her ORCID identifier 0000-0003-1438-2903, has left an indelible mark on the scientific community."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 668, "end": 778, "text": "Her research endeavors, though multifaceted, have been deeply rooted in her affiliation with Hospital del Mar."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 779, "end": 941, "text": "It is here that she has dedicated herself to advancing the boundaries of medical knowledge, driven by an insatiable curiosity and a desire to improve human lives."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 942, "end": 1077, "text": "One of the most compelling pieces of evidence supporting Clara's association with Hospital del Mar is her extensive publication record."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1078, "end": 1188, "text": "A thorough examination of her research papers reveals a consistent thread – her affiliation with the hospital."}, "D2S10": {"document_num